// ftetest.map -- human-editable source for the behavioural-test room.
//
// A single hollow 512^3 room (interior +/-256) with 16-unit walls, one
// info_player_start, and worldspawn. Compile with ericw-tools qbsp (see
// ../compile.sh) to regenerate maps/ftetest.bsp. The committed .bsp is produced
// either by that path or, when no qbsp is installed, by tools/gen_bsp.py, which
// emits an equivalent room. 100% original authorship -- no id Software content.
//
// Brush plane triples wind clockwise as seen from the front, so face normals
// point out of each solid wall (standard Quake .map convention).
